If you struggle sitting in trades, well, don't develop your strategies around sitting in trades.

1076
01:07:08,820 --> 01:07:13,980
Develop your strategies based on the strengths that you have. Based on your emotional strengths.

1077
01:07:15,040 --> 01:07:18,100
Then, we discussed the time required for success.

1078
01:07:18,100 --> 01:07:20,990
How long do you expect it to take till you achieve success?

1079
01:07:20,990 --> 01:07:24,170
And then lastly, the overall process.

