01:08:23,760 --> 01:08:30,280
You need to find any sort of observation that was either as you expected or not as you expected.

1097
01:08:30,280 --> 01:08:37,040
Because it's this constant analysis and self-evaluation that is one, going to improve this trade strategy over the long run,

1098
